                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60 f 2/23: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Einstein</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-06-03T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1927—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 3—1:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>22. Your 453, May 5th. Treaty draft submitted today to Foreign Office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Einstein</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
